OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy with showers or
OL,6,Flonger spells of rain, showers most
OL,7,Ffrequent in the west. Windy with fresh
OL,8,Fto strong west or southwesterly winds,
OL,9,Foccasionally gale force across the
OL,10,FWestern Isles later this afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening will see
OL,13,Fshowers, some longer spells of rain in
OL,14,Fthe west at first. Then showers
OL,15,Fbecoming fewer and lighter during the
OL,16,Fearly hours. Strong westerly winds
OL,17,Feasing overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
