OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA few light showers at first,
OL,6,Fotherwise a dry start. Rain will
OL,7,Fspread from the west during the late
OL,8,Fmorning and afternoon, turning light
OL,9,Fand patchy later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,12,Fwith showers on Saturday, fresh to
OL,13,Fstrong westerly winds. A few early
OL,14,Fshowers on Sunday, otherwise dry. Rain
OL,15,Fwill spread northeast for a time on
OL,16,FMonday, then dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
